## Win thesis (shared value)

**CDC / U.S.:** Stop threats at source — Safer · Stronger · More Prosperous.  
**Host governments:** Local systems detect, notify, and respond faster (7-1-7).  
**FairBanks:** Uganda-registered clinic + Community Reach + FCHIP that feeds MoH — not a parallel silo.  
**Communities:** Earlier alerts and clearer referral paths.

